@.str.11 = private unnamed_addr constant [349 x i8] c"Base class of the Truncated\0ASigned Distance Function (TSDF) volume This volume is usually used to integrate\0Asurface data (e.g., a series of RGB-D images) into a Mesh or PointCloud. The\0Abasic technique is presented in the following paper:\0A\0AA volumetric method for building complex models from range images\0A\0AB. Curless and M. Levoy\0A\0AIn SIGGRAPH, 1996\00", align 1
